    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Can't Have Another Planar Pact Feat)</em></p><p>You struck a bargain with a power of the Shadowfell. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Darkvision.</strong> You gain Darkvision with a range of 60 feet. If you already have Darkvision, its range increases by 30 feet instead.</p><p><strong>Shadow Blood.</strong> Whenever you roll a die to determine how many Hit Points you regain while you're entirely within Dim Light or Darkness, you can reroll the die if it shows a 1, and you must use the new roll.</p><p><strong>Shroud of Shadows.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can surround yourself with a 5-foot Emanation of Dim Light for 1 minute. It ends early if you dismiss it (no action required) or if you have the Incapacitated condition. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-mHToyjCKmViwF5DF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect <em>Shadow Darkvision</em> gives 60 feet of Darkvision, or 30 more feet if you already have it. <em>Shroud of Shadows</em> spends its use; Shadow Blood is not automated.</p></section>",
